OL,3,GNEWSAProtest over plan for data centre
OL,4,Anear nature site
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have taken part in a
OL,7,Fcity centre protest against a proposed
OL,8,Flarge data centre near a nature
OL,9,Freserve.
OL,11,FPlans have been submitted for the
OL,12,FNorwich Apex facility, whose 150MW
OL,13,Fenergy needs would be powered by
OL,14,Foffshore wind.
OL,16,FOne protester calling himself
OL,17,F"Shivering Beetle" said: "I genuinely
OL,18,Fdo not believe that this can have a
OL,19,Fpositive impact on the environment."
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
