OL,3,GNEWSAProtest over plan for data centre
OL,4,Anear nature site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Bartram, chief executive of
OL,7,FNorwich Apex, said: "We understand how
OL,8,Fimportant Norfolk's natural environment
OL,9,Fis to local people, and we take
OL,10,Fconcerns about wildlife, trees and
OL,11,Fnoise seriously."
